<title>UK: Jan Flotta programme 6.36 mln bls vs 6.5 mln in De.</title>
<headline>Jan Flotta programme 6.36 mln bls vs 6.5 mln in De.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The January North Sea Flotta crude oil programme will total 6.36 million barrels, little changed from 6.5 million in December, traders said.</p>
